# AI Comment Generator

## 1. Project Overview

The AI Comment Generator is a Python-based project that uses an OpenAI-compatible chat API to generate clear, concise, one-line comments or docstrings describing the purpose of a code snippet.

The project demonstrates how artificial intelligence can improve code readability and maintainability by automatically producing meaningful explanations of source code.

## 2. Project Objectives

- Initialize an OpenAI client using environment variables.
- Accept a Python code snippet as input.
- Construct a parameterized prompt based on the supplied code.
- Send the prompt to an AI chat model.
- Generate a one-line comment or docstring.
- Print the generated comment and return it from the function.

## 3. Technologies Used

- **Python** — implementation language.
- **OpenAI Python SDK** — communication with the chat API.
- **Virtual environment (`venv`)** — isolated Python dependencies.
- **OpenAI-compatible API endpoint** — configured through environment variables.

